# Optional: enables "Sign in with GitHub" (Device Flow) instead of pasting a token.
# Register an OAuth App at https://github.com/settings/developers
#   - Application name: anything
#   - Homepage URL: anything
#   - Tick "Enable Device Flow"
# Copy the Client ID here. It is public by design — no client secret is needed.
# Then: cp .env.example .env && npm run build
WXT_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
